    "scope_check": "Inbox triage and correspondence. No queue item started: step 3 is held pending Director confirmation, and steps 1 and 2 remain unstarted and unauthorized. Read-only review of the revised OGF-1 performed as triage. No pattern-shape call; no charter, config, permission or CLAUDE.md edit; nothing committed or pushed.",
    "applies_principles": [
      "bounded-authority -- a peer seat cannot lift an instruction the Director gave this seat directly; the relay is evidence of intent, not the instruction",
      "honest-limits -- the hold is stated with its discharge condition rather than left as unexplained inaction",
      "evidence-led -- the ticket's own Status line is quoted from the 21:44 revision rather than characterized",
      "seat-vs-incumbent -- the disagreement is recorded in the substrate so a later session inherits the reasoning, not just the outcome",
      "promotion-follows-adoption -- the standing-rule option is offered as the durable fix rather than re-litigating each instance"
    ],
